    <string name="thanks_mp_desc">Yunghgoh neix gwnz youz MP-Manager: cuengq song cawz cienz, gwnz doengz cuengq song (fuzceiq, yienz, diq haeuj cuengq doengh); hangz vwnzgen — bauhingq gvaq nding, mingz caeuq «ngiz + daeuj»; cuengq hangz ⋮ caeuq ban «gwnz doengz aeu» gouh; laengsaep caeuq fuzvunz caeuq loek diuciz; hangz gwn; bawzswhswh miz hangz daih caeuq hangz giz; laengsaep, cangz, vwnzgen gvaq dingz; Shizuku caeuq moxloeg; ngaiz hawz caeuq gyaeuj, soq vwnzgen caeuq gyaeuj soq; cangq bwnzdi doengh. Cawj sij MP-Manager yungh cangq GPL-3.0 youq GitHub (https://github.com/AbdurazaaqMohammed/MP-Manager), byauj vunz cawz gyausauq ndaej cawz cienz; cawj sij AbdurazaaqMohammed guh gvaq cingj guh; cawj sij de cengmingz vunz doengh ndaej gwnz MT Gwnli Fwnzgen cangq hek vunz, byauj yunghgoh neix miz bwnjhingq cawz.</string>
